## 💡 Kullanım Örneği

### Vendor Balance Sorgulama

```csharp
// Native vendor service ile vendor al
var vendor = await _vendorService.GetVendorByIdAsync(vendorId);

// Extension service ile balance al
var balance = await _vendorMarketplaceService
    .GetVendorBalanceAsync(vendor.Id);

Console.WriteLine($"{vendor.Name} balance: {balance.CurrentBalance}");
```

### Payout Request

```csharp
// Payout talebi oluştur
var payout = await _vendorMarketplaceService.RequestPayoutAsync(
    vendorId: 123,
    amount: 1000m,
    paymentMethod: "Bank Transfer"
);

// Admin onayı
await _vendorMarketplaceService.ApprovePayoutAsync(payout.Id);

// İşlem tamamlandı
await _vendorMarketplaceService.CompletePayoutAsync(
    payout.Id, 
    externalReference: "TXN-123456"
);
```

